meta {
  name: Get All Driver - Vehicle Relation For Management / Assigning
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/driver/vehicle/list
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Driver - Vehicle Relation For Management / Assigning

  This request is used to get all driver with their assigned vehicle for management / assigning. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Driver and vehicle fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "driver fetched",
    "data": {
      "vehicle": [
        {
          "id": "8585ab36-fc67-139c-35c6-608931244634",
          "vehicle_name": "Non dolorum velit corrupti",
          "vehicle_plate_number": "C 80 OON"
        }
      ],
      "driver": [
        {
          "id": "a3f743ae-a373-11f0-86ad-3216422910e8",
          "username": "tester_jhona",
          "fullname": "asd"
        }
      ],
      "assigned": [
        {
          "id": "1c8a4d88-d9b0-11ed-afa1-0242ac120002",
          "vehicle_plate_number": "C 80 OON",
          "vehicle_id": "8585ab36-fc67-139c-35c6-608931244634",
          "driver_id": "a3f743ae-a373-11f0-86ad-3216422910e8",
          "username": "tester_jhona",
          "fullname": "asd"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — Protected route — requires sign-in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — Driver or vehicle not found**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "driver not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something went wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}